{"data":{"body":"**[P1] Preserve context-free decoding for initial input.** Invocation input is serialized before a durable ARN exists through `SerDes.serialize(Object)`, but this invokes the context-aware deserializer. A valid SerDes using distinct raw and contextual encodings will therefore fail every initial invocation. Add a context-free dispatch method to `SerDesRunner` and use it here\u2014and for other externally produced raw boundaries\u2014with a regression test covering distinct encodings.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7pAy1O","finding_digest":"4266850d14e674f28bb8e8c864421f8d32748f994ba3c99cc82e385a087bc243","finding_id":"arf_v1_ijtikdiu4z2pfc5y5degiqq7ru","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::extractuserinput::raw-context-overload-mismatch","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::extractuserinput::raw-context-overload-mismatch","line":294,"observation_digest":"632cfae0bed9f43a6e2264c9aea10072450fb05202970812f389b420092637f3","observation_id":"aro_v1_mmwpvyf63h2du3rcmte25iiaoj","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-01T23:20:41Z","review_id":"arr_v1_hoszbnsyb5dus6uvdwmmh6rr7w","reviewed_base_sha":"d8ed0d4a55bafe23a7f2c1fb71f66204097dda95","reviewed_head_sha":"3e353306c1b8ea5bfae1cd97b720923d2032a491","reviewer":"codex","start_line":294,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":672},"record_id":"art_v1_4ob4vtfxunb2juztvhfwdpomyc","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-01T23:20:41Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
